---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Tracebook — search a real manual set, live">
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-10 pb-8 md:pt-12 md:pb-10">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-gold">
      &#8982; live demo &middot; dodge viper manuals
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl font-medium leading-[0.98] tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl">
      Ask a car anything. <em class="italic wonk">Get the page.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl font-display italic text-lg leading-relaxed text-inkSoft">
      Ask in plain language; the answer cites the exact factory-manual
      pages it came from. Try it — it's live.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WIDGET SLOT (placeholder until /api/demo/*) -->
<section class="border-t border-ink/10 bg-paperDeep/40 py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
    <div id="tracebook-demo-slot"
         data-tracebook-demo="automotive"
         data-api="https://automotive.demo.tracebook.ai"
         class="rounded-lg border border-ink/15 bg-paper p-10 text-center">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-gold">the search box goes here</div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md font-display italic text-lg text-inkSoft">
        Model + year picker, one search box, streamed cited answers —
        right on this page, no login.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-ink/15 bg-paperDeep/60 px-5 py-3 text-sm text-inkMute">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-small">live demo</span> coming online
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs italic text-inkMute">
      Manual content used with permission from Stellantis for this
      small-scale demonstration.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY CITATIONS -->
<section class="border-t border-ink/10 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-tight md:text-5xl">
      Why the citations matter
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-inkSoft">
        A chatbot that paraphrases a manual is a liability — you can&rsquo;t
        torque a head bolt on &ldquo;probably.&rdquo; Tracebook answers are grounded:
        retrieval finds the pages (text AND the diagrams themselves),
        generation is constrained to what those pages say, and every
        claim links back so you can check the source before you touch
        the machine.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-inkSoft">
        The same applies to your machines. Swap the Viper manuals for
        your equipment library and this exact experience runs under your
        brand — for your customers, or your maintenance team.
        <a href="/machine-oems" class="font-medium text-ink underline decoration-gold decoration-2 underline-offset-4">See the OEM story</a> or
        <a href="/maintenance" class="font-medium text-ink underline decoration-gold decoration-2 underline-offset-4">the maintenance story</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script is:inline src="/widget/tracebook-demo-widget.js" defer></script>
</Base>
